  "description": "## Pet catalogue\nThe workspace.pets child route renders at /app/pets inside the persistent workspace shell. Existing pet cards provide detail navigation. Loads normalized public demo records through petData without modifying shared service data or caches.\n\nDropdown value models are two-way; explicit onValueChange(value, event) handlers assign the associated selection before calling syncStatus or onLocalFilters. Watches remain supplementary rather than the sole update path. syncStatus sets requestedStatus synchronously through loadPets, deduplicating initialization, callback and watch triggers for the same status. Category and sort callbacks only recompute local results; search retains its 250 ms debounce and reads the latest model. Pagination onPageChange(currentPage) explicitly assigns the page before slicing. Stale-response protection, retry behavior and existing presentation are unchanged.",
  "name": "pets",
  "params": {},
  "parentPageName": "workspace",
  "type": "page",
  "url": "/pets",
  "variables": [
    {
      "id": "service",
      "name": "petData",
      "resourceIdentity": "services/pet-data",
      "type": "service"
    },
    {
      "name": "$q",
      "type": "service"
    },
    {
      "description": "Two-way search model; the core input debounces its change callback by 250 ms. Callbacks read the current model so delayed callbacks cannot resurrect cleared text.",
      "name": "searchQuery",
      "type": "property",
      "value": "''"
    },
    {
      "description": "Two-way server-selected status; explicit Dropdown callback assigns its value before syncStatus. Defaults to available.",
      "name": "status",
      "type": "property",
      "value": "'available'"
    },
    {
      "description": "Two-way client category selection; explicit Dropdown callback assigns its value before local filtering. The all-categories sentinel cannot collide with prefixed category values.",
      "name": "category",
