    {
      "body": "if ($ctrl.requestedStatus === $ctrl.status) { return; }\n$ctrl.category = '*';\n$ctrl.currentPage = 1;\nreturn $ctrl.loadPets(false);",
      "description": "Initial load and server reload on status changes, explicitly called by statusChanged as well as supplementary watches. requestedStatus is assigned synchronously in loadPets, so repeated initialization/callback/watch triggers for the same status do not issue duplicate requests. Category resets because its options belong to a different dataset.",
